{"sections":[{"slug":"拟射影簇","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"拟射影簇"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">拟射影簇</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“拟射影簇”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">拟射影簇</span> (quasi-projective variety) <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/射影簇","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">射影簇</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/开嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">开子簇</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">也即射影空间的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部闭嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部闭子集</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">也即射影空间中一个</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">开集与一个</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">闭集的交</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数簇","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数簇</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}